473	   273	     *  is retired (the pool shows no cuts). Each member with a cut gets the pot
474	   274	     *  times their share over the shares of the members with a cut added up, rounded half to even to two
475	   275	     *  decimals; the remainder goes to the member with the smallest non-zero cut (the latest added on a tie; a
476	   276	     *  member with no cut gets none), or to the last member with a cut and a share when no cut is non-zero, so the cuts total exactly the pot (all 0.00 when no member has a cut). */
